    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aTolampis\u300bis a 2D exploration-adventure game with a dark yet healing atmosphere. You will incarnate as a firefly to explore a mysterious forest named Tolampis, unraveling the dark puzzles shrouding the forest amid the unique visual experience of watercolor hand-drawn style and healing music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore while flying, searching for crucial clues and props in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The healing-style musical atmosphere allows you to focus on and enjoy the entire gameplay process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musical elements will become important puzzle-solving links during gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy visual effects integrated with watercolor hand-drawn art, which breathes life into the wonderful game visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will search for faint lights in the dark forest and explore amid psychedelic music and whimsical ideas.</p>",
